class:: Diststoch
summary:: Free chaotic breakpoint oscillator with asymmetric barriers
related:: Classes/Gendreve, Classes/Chaosgen
categories:: UGens>Generators>Stochastic

description::

A breakpoint oscillator whose control points follow a free chaotic walk. Each point
carries a kicked-rotor map: the kick drives an unbounded momentum, and the amplitude
bounds and their barrier behaviours fold it back. The bounds can be asymmetric, adding
DC and even harmonics.

code::ampKick:: is the order-to-chaos dial. Small values leave the walk quasi-periodic;
above roughly 1 it becomes chaotic, with periodic windows scattered through the range.
The distribution reshapes the kick: code::ampDist = 0:: (linear) gives the plain kicked
rotor, the others bend it. code::knum:: is fixed at build time.

classmethods::

method:: ar
argument:: minfreq
Lower fundamental bound (Hz).
argument:: maxfreq
Upper fundamental bound (Hz).
argument:: knum
Control points (fixed). Default 12.
argument:: ampDist
Distribution: 0 linear, 1 cauchy, 2 logistic, 3 hyperbcos, 4 arcsine, 5 exponential, 6 sinus. Default 0.
argument:: ampDistParam
0–1. Default 0.5.
argument:: durDist
Duration distribution (same codes). Default 0.
argument:: durDistParam
0–1. Default 0.5.
argument:: ampKick
Amplitude rotor kick. Chaotic above ~1. Default 2.0.
argument:: durKick
Duration rotor kick. 0 holds the pitch steady. Default 2.0.
argument:: ampLo
Lower amplitude bound. Default -1.0.
argument:: ampHi
Upper amplitude bound. Default 1.0.
argument:: barrierLo
Lower bound behaviour: 0 mirror, 1 wrap, 2 clip, 3 randomize. Default 0.
argument:: barrierHi
Upper bound behaviour (same codes). Default 0.
argument:: interp
0 hold, 1 linear, 2 cosine. Default 1.
argument:: mul
argument:: add

examples::
code::
{ Diststoch.ar(150, 150, 14, ampKick: MouseX.kr(0.2, 6), durKick: 0) * 0.2 ! 2 }.play;

{ Diststoch.ar(80, 200, 14, ampDist: 1, ampKick: 2.5, ampLo: -0.6, barrierHi: 2) * 0.2 ! 2 }.play;

{ Diststoch.ar(80, 400, 14, ampKick: 2.5, durKick: 2.0) * 0.2 ! 2 }.play;

{ Diststoch.ar(150, 150, 14, ampKick: 2.5, durKick: 0, ampLo: MouseX.kr(-1, 0), barrierHi: 2) * 0.2 ! 2 }.play;

{ Diststoch.ar(120, 480, 20, ampDist: 4, ampDistParam: MouseY.kr(0.05, 1), ampKick: MouseX.kr(0.5, 5)) * 0.2 ! 2 }.play;

{ Diststoch.ar(200, 200, 10, ampKick: 3.0, durKick: 0, barrierLo: 3, barrierHi: 3, interp: 0) * 0.2 ! 2 }.play;

{ Diststoch.ar(40, 40, 32, ampDist: 2, ampDistParam: 0.9, ampKick: 1.6, durKick: 0, interp: 2) * 0.25 ! 2 }.play;

{ Diststoch.ar(90, 360, 14, ampKick: LFNoise0.kr(2).range(0.3, 5), durKick: 1.2, ampLo: -0.5, barrierHi: 1) * 0.2 ! 2 }.play;
::
